@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### 0. Existing bookings (should be [] on a fresh database)
GET {{base}}/bookings

### 1. Check resource ids
GET {{base}}/resources

### 2. Check member ids
GET {{base}}/members

### 3. Valid booking: Boardroom 09:00-11:00, 4 people -> 201, totalCost 160.00
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T09:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T11:00:00", "attendees": 4 }

### 4. OVERLAP: Boardroom 10:00-12:00 -> 409 (the demo case!)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 2, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T10:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T12:00:00", "attendees": 2 }

### 5. ADJACENT: Boardroom 11:00-12:00 -> 201 (allowed)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 2, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T11:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T12:00:00", "attendees": 2 }

### 6. Start after end -> 400
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "resourceId": 2, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T15:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T14:00:00", "attendees": 2 }

### 7. Desk with 2 attendees -> 400
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "resourceId": 3, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T09:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T10:00:00", "attendees": 2 }

### 8. Focus Room (capacity 4) with 6 attendees -> 400
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "resourceId": 2, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T09:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T10:00:00", "attendees": 6 }

### 9. Desk for 1.5 hours at 12.50/h -> 201, totalCost 18.75
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "resourceId": 4, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T09:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T10:30:00", "attendees": 1 }

### 10. Unknown member -> 404
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 999, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-21T09:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-21T10:00:00", "attendees": 1 }

### 11. Missing fields -> 400
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1 }

### 12. Update booking 1 to 09:30-11:00 (overlaps only itself) -> 200, totalCost 120.00
PUT {{base}}/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T09:30:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T11:00:00", "attendees": 4 }

### 13. Update booking 1 to 10:00-11:30 (overlaps booking 2) -> 409
PUT {{base}}/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T10:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T11:30:00", "attendees": 4 }

### 14. Cancel booking 2 (11:00-12:00) -> 200, status CANCELLED
PUT {{base}}/bookings/2/cancel

### 15. Book 11:00-12:00 again -> 201 (cancel freed the slot)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 2, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T11:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T12:00:00", "attendees": 3 }

### 16. Update the cancelled booking -> 400
PUT {{base}}/bookings/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 2, "resourceId": 1, "startDateTime": "2026-11-20T13:00:00", "endDateTime": "2026-11-20T14:00:00", "attendees": 2 }

### 17. Cancel it again -> 400
PUT {{base}}/bookings/2/cancel

### 18. All bookings (current and past) -> 200
GET {{base}}/bookings

### 19. Unknown booking -> 404
GET {{base}}/bookings/999